: "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "06_grid_highlight_2560.png", "id": "1326832015698443", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_1326832019031776_9009436588314541824_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-X_iddF7Y_QQ7kNvwGq602B&_nc_oc=AdoYFUp0YaCI1ouRMcOsWqon-juo1n9ItKk99SWtBAobf5a9Mllo8RO1Kg4kxbu-_EI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgKBJJ9n6HQ-Wjj4EuOlHHnkDpIYtkmUxBjV5aJzWmew&oe=6A9FF809"}, {"file_name": "07_folder_highlight_2560.png", "id": "990218473908017", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_990218477241350_2996134407457221442_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eVhxgasqR2UQ7kNvwFbwNOb&_nc_oc=AdoWxzZfW6Q7QHRqU0t3d83eNzFHbFH_wzbIOY0AgGSyhVjA7IlbY0A9ELIDCpplrSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJkRNbDXICz4b_4izrjCb8hcg1mO32rLrJAGjvhTZt1DQ&oe=6AA0040C"}, {"file_name": "05_photo_fullscreen.png", "id": "27397995419826983", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_27397995423160316_5258734423451984216_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V4AX5KQp4DYQ7kNvwFr7QDK&_nc_oc=AdqIAwd1BZi1_eDXlDpaTCeGM0t4ycyEbYBA6jeRgNdwcXok2-aKOYMGXY51vz4wHh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJUoJpRy2aruY7JR-DX7LCE1ZxbudY6Vn3Wfs7PXi7FuQ&oe=6AA01F14"}, {"file_name": "06_komga.png", "id": "983184151148814", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507894093_983184154482147_3375183170398943269_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZEKPDtw5vlsQ7kNvwGm9Zic&_nc_oc=Adrm-G4KmN9f4ea1XWkbrFjBHLKyj9ssbbHQ-c_VRbF9VK-n52AFgyVZEvxEnNmM4hI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIf3JMICVQncYBRjxbslsQmNndGr-GjpD01bujOC_UNMA&oe=6A9FFAD8"}, {"file_name": "02_manga_spread_bw.png", "id": "1581978213544674", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620497_1581978220211340_3920643153682528753_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oY8fzy2uEVUQ7kNvwHpoJfp&_nc_oc=Ado3fNqfKjb1fPTv0cfcKEmXqu0kv4s-AI3BWlRJgxBom8Rh7NQJyLq-L5S-Jg60Vpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL51nuhJ6o__PxUThqRrGvFzamO-UvJWjqMUoB5ugM5GQ&oe=6AA01BE0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1739803200793397", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623314_1739803204126730_8596872080155761752_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MT2kdbihGRQQ7kNvwFHZrA5&_nc_oc=AdofFaKBja8vBi8vpO5NbMUgVQHm6SGf8Bs10sjzysI-AZVxfQxJq7nErSLT5xAFxh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIzIRP5kxtGjEEHRRcmAHjfQT3lDvGxMN_3txTiVadc4w&oe=6AA0204B"}, "display_name": "Peekr VR", "keywords": ["manga", "comic", "viewer", "reader", "VR"], "long_description": "No unzipping. No converting. No copying.\n\nOpen your comic archives straight from the folder. Peekr VR is a VR viewer for the comics, photos, and videos you already own.\n\nOPEN ARCHIVES DIRECTLY\nReads ZIP, CBZ, RAR, CBR, 7z, and TAR with no extraction. Two-page spreads, auto page-turn, and unlimited zoom \u2014 lean right up to a favorite page and take in every brushstroke and line your favorite artist drew.\n\nCONNECT TO YOUR NAS (SMB) & KOMGA SERVER\nBrowse your NAS folders right from the headset \u2014 no PC, no copying. Or connect directly to your Komga server: series search (Japanese/IME input), continue reading synced to the server, favorites, and automatic per-series reading direction (RTL/LTR). Connection settings never leave your device.\n\nPRIVACY IS A FEATURE\nWhat you view is yours alone \u2014 never sent anywhere.\n- No data collection, analytics, or telemetry \u2014 ever\n- No \"All Files Access\" permission\n- Comic archives are read only from folders you choose\n- The only network traffic is to the NAS you set up\n\nPHOTOS AND VIDEOS TOO\nBrowse images and videos from device or NAS. View photos as two-page spreads, like manga. Curved screen, video thumbnails, continuous playback.\n\nPLEASE NOTE\n- Designed for Meta Quest 3\n- Touch controllers only (no hand tracking, to prevent accidental input)\n- No content is included \u2014 bring your own files\n\nBuilt by an independent developer \u2014 feedback and bug reports welcome.\n\nManga shown in screenshots: \"Give My Regards to Black Jack\" by SHUHO SATO", "short_description": "ZIP, RAR, 7z \u2014 open them without opening them.\n\nPeekr VR is a viewer for your own media collection. It opens ZIP / CBZ / RAR / CBR / 7z / TAR archives directly with no extraction, connects straight to your NAS over SMB, with unlimited zoom \u2014 close enough to study every brushstroke. Two-page spreads, no accounts, no cloud, no data collection. Your library stays yours."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1005217302243227", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Peekr VR", "keywords": ["\u6f2b\u753b", "\u30b3\u30df\u30c3\u30af", "\u81ea\u708a", "\u30ea\u30fc\u30c0\u30fc", "\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30ef\u30fc"], "long_description": "\u89e3\u51cd\u3082\u3001\u5909\u63db\u3082\u3001\u30b3\u30d4\u30fc\u3082\u3044\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3002\n\nZIP\u30fbRAR\u30fb7z\u30fbCBZ\u2026\u2026\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u6f2b\u753b\u30a2\u30fc\u30ab\u30a4\u30d6\u3092\u3001\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u304b\u3089\u9078\u3076\u3060\u3051\u3067\u305d\u306e\u307e\u307e\u958b\u304f\u3002Peekr VR\u306f\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u81ea\u8eab\u306e\u6f2b\u753b\u30fb\u5199\u771f\u30fb\u52d5\u753b\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306eVR\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30ef\u30fc\u3067\u3059\u3002NAS\u306b\u7f6e\u3044\u305f\u307e\u307e\u3001\u76ee\u306e\u524d\u306e\u5927\u753b\u9762\u3067\u3002\u30bd\u30d5\u30a1\u3067\u3082\u3001\u5bdd\u8ee2\u3093\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3069\u3053\u307e\u3067\u3082\u5bc4\u3063\u3066\u697d\u3057\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n\u3054\u81ea\u8eab\u306e\u6240\u6709\u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2\u3092\u898b\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u3067\u3059\uff08\u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30f3\u30c4\u306f\u540c\u68b1\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\uff09\u3002\n\n\u3010\u6f2b\u753b\u30a2\u30fc\u30ab\u30a4\u30d6\u3092\u305d\u306e\u307e\u307e\u958b\u304f\u3011\n\u5bfe\u5fdc\u5f62\u5f0f\u306f ZIP / CBZ / RAR / CBR / 7z / TAR\u3002\u898b\u958b\u304d\u8868\u793a\u30fb\u81ea\u52d5\u9001\u308a\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u305d\u3057\u3066\u30ba\u30fc\u30e0\u306b\u4e0a\u9650\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u304a\u6c17\u306b\u5165\u308a\u306e\u4e00\u679a\u306b\u9854\u3092\u8fd1\u3065\u3051\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3001\u4f5c\u5bb6\u306e\u7b46\u3065\u304b\u3044\u3001\u7dda\u306e\u5165\u308a\u629c\u304d\u3001\u63cf\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u306e\u9685\u3005\u307e\u3067\u2014\u2014\u5fc3\u3086\u304f\u307e\u3067\u5473\u308f\u3048\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n\u3010NAS\uff08SMB\uff09\uff0f Komga \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u306b\u76f4\u63a5\u63a5\u7d9a\u3011\nPC\u3092\u7d4c\u7531\u305b\u305a\u3001Quest\u5358\u4f53\u3067NAS\u306e\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c0\u3092\u958b\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5927\u5bb9\u91cf\u306e\u30b3\u30ec\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u8ee2\u9001\u305b\u305a\u3001\u7f6e\u3044\u305f\u307e\u307e\u8aad\u3081\u308b\u3002\u3055\u3089\u306b\u3001\u81ea\u5b85\u306e Komga \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u306b\u3082\u76f4\u7d50\u2014\u2014\u30b7\u30ea\u30fc\u30ba\u691c\u7d22\uff08\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u5165\u529b\u5bfe\u5fdc\uff09\u3001\u7d9a\u304d\u304b\u3089\u8aad\u3080\uff08\u8aad\u66f8\u9032\u6357\u3092\u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u3068\u540c\u671f\uff09\u3001\u304a\u6c17\u306b\u5165\u308a\u3001\u30b7\u30ea\u30fc\u30ba\u3054\u3068\u306e\u8aad\u307f\u65b9\u5411\uff08\u53f3\u958b\u304d\uff0f\u5de6\u958b\u304d\uff09\u306e\u81ea\u52d5\u53cd\u6620\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u63a5\u7d9a\u60c5\u5831\u306f\u304a\u4f7f\u3044\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u3060\u3051\u4fdd\u5b58\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n\u301